    "text": "LOCALSpaceX rocket launch today from Vandenberg. How to watch liftoffHere's everything to know about the latest SpaceX mission, and how to watch a webcast of the Falcon 9 launching from the Vandenberg Space Force Base. Eric LagattaUSA TODAY NETWORKMarch 20, 2026, 6:02 a.m. PTAnother SpaceX Falcon 9 rocket is due to launch this week from the Vandenberg Space Force Base in Southern California.Ready for liftoff? The two-stage rocket should be widely visible in person as it thunders into the sky to deploy another batch of SpaceX's Starlink broadband internet satellites to Earth orbit.Or, you can go with the virtual option and watch a livestream of the mission from home.",
